  "pub:id": "sb226-disclosure-and-ai-defense-disclose-genai-high-risk-proactive",
  "title": "Proactive GenAI Disclosure In High-Risk Interactions",
  "content": "A supplier engaged in a \"high-risk AI interaction\" in a regulated occupation must proactively disclose GenAI use before the interaction begins — verbally at the start of an oral exchange, and in writing before a written exchange. The high-risk tier is statutorily defined and narrower than general consumer interactions.",
